---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import * as Icons from 'lucide-astro';
---

<Layout title="Contacto | Raúl Riesco">
	<article class="static-page">
		<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Volver al Dashboard</a>
		<h1>Contacto / <span class="text-gradient">Contact</span></h1>
		
		<div class="contact-card">
			<div class="contact-info">
				<div class="icon-box">
					<Icons.Mail size={32} />
				</div>
				<div>
					<p class="label">Correo Electrónico</p>
					<a href="mailto:r.riesco@edu.gva.es" class="email-link">r.riesco@edu.gva.es</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="message">
				<p>Per a contactar-me, podeu utilitzar el correu anterior.</p>
				<p>Para contactarme podéis utilizar el correo anterior.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.static-page {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 4rem auto;
		background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.3);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		padding: 3rem;
	}
	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent-light);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}
	.text-gradient {
		background: linear-gradient(45deg, #a855f7, #6366f1);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
	}
	.contact-card {
		background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
	}
	.contact-info {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.icon-box {
		width: 4rem;
		height: 4rem;
		background: rgba(136, 58, 234, 0.2);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: var(--accent-light);
	}
	.label {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}
	.email-link {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: white;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s;
	}
	.email-link:hover {
		color: var(--accent-light);
	}
	.message {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #cbd5e1;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
